  "localChange": "Original supersampled architectural backing below exact native masked art. Native renderer retains original depth writes and masks. Cabinet readiness observes actual unboosted plunger contact, not active-ball spawn; subsequent feeding shows scoped elapsed progress. Physical inputs dispatch once per non-repeated keydown to existing native gameplay functions, outside removed ImGui capture. Native physics, collision/depth records and DAT masks unchanged.",
